Subject: [PATCH 15/15] =?UTF-8?q?netgen:=20cong=20'ban=20tap=20!=3D=20ban?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20that'=20cho=20chainId=20=E2=80=94=20C-4=20(B-11)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

chainId 9000000009 cam cung trong cChainGenesis => moi mang netgen sinh ra, tap hay
that, deu mang ban sac cua mang that. Va netgen khong in con so do o dau ca.

networkID la chuyen noi bo avalanchego. Thu VI DOC la chainId, va EIP-155 buoc chu ky
vao chainId chu khong vao networkID.

Nay chainId di qua resolveChainID (chainid.go), doc A1_CHAIN_ID:
  chainId = that + co khac chu  -> im lang di qua (luot THAT, ban sac dung)
  chainId = that + khong khac   -> CANH BAO LON (hoac A1_CHAIN_ID_KHAI_NHAN)
  chainId != that + co khac chu -> CHAN (khac vinh vien mot ban sac sai)
  chainId != that + khong khac  -> in ra, day la duong dung cho mang tap
Them tran EIP-2294 (MAX_SAFE_INTEGER) va in chainId o dong tong ket LUON LUON.

Bat doi xung 'sua duoc thi canh bao, khong sua duoc thi chan' la CO Y — chan cung
duong dev quen thuoc gen-network.sh 5 se chi tao ra thoi quen di vong (cung ly le
da dung cho canhBaoSelfBond).

7 ca nghiem thu, 3 ca do dung cho.

